{"format_version":"0.1","record_type":"person_source_bundle","requested_person_id":"cbr-p000218","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","person_ids":["cbr-p000218"],"persons":[{"id":"cbr-p000218","label":"伯陽（幽王時）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"伯陽甫","mention_ids":["c-shiji-004-zhou:m039-0028"]},{"surface":"周太史伯陽","mention_ids":["c-shiji-004-zhou:m040-0070"]},{"surface":"太史伯陽","mention_ids":["c-shiji-004-zhou:m040-0414"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m039-0028","chapter_id":"c-shiji-004-zhou","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:p039","quote":"伯陽甫"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m040-0070","chapter_id":"c-shiji-004-zhou","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:p040","quote":"周太史伯陽"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m040-0414","chapter_id":"c-shiji-004-zhou","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:p040","quote":"太史伯陽"}],"identity_note":"依本卷特定時代與敘事建立；同名與世襲官號不得全庫合併，本名未見不補造。","review":"ai_provisional"}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-shiji-004-zhou","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-004","chapter_id":"c-shiji-004-zhou","mention_count":3,"mention_ids":["c-shiji-004-zhou:m039-0028","c-shiji-004-zhou:m040-0070","c-shiji-004-zhou:m040-0414"],"paragraph_ids":["c-shiji-004-zhou:p039","c-shiji-004-zhou:p040"],"passage_count":2}],"most_mentioned_source_ids":["s-shiji-004-zhou"],"mention_count_policy":{"scope":"currently_annotated_mentions","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"family_paths":[],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m039-0028","start":28,"end":31,"surface":"伯陽甫","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000218","status":"source_identified","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:p039","chapter_id":"c-shiji-004-zhou"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m040-0070","start":70,"end":75,"surface":"周太史伯陽","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000218","status":"source_identified","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:p040","chapter_id":"c-shiji-004-zhou"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m040-0414","start":414,"end":418,"surface":"太史伯陽","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000218","status":"source_identified","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:p040","chapter_id":"c-shiji-004-zhou"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:p039","text":"四十六年，宣王崩，子幽王宮𣵀立。幽王二年，西周三川皆震。伯陽甫曰：「周將亡矣。夫天地之氣，不失其序；若過其序，民亂之也。陽伏而不能出，陰迫而不能蒸，於是有地震。今三川實震，是陽失其所而填陰也。陽失而在陰，原必塞；原塞，國必亡。夫水土演而民用也。土無所演，民乏財用，不亡何待！昔伊、洛竭而夏亡，河竭而商亡。今周德若二代之季矣，其川原又塞，塞必竭。夫國必依山川，山崩川竭，亡國之徵也。川竭必山崩。若國亡不過十年，數之紀也。天之所棄，不過其紀。」是歲也，三川竭，岐山崩。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m039-0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"宣王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000213","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m039-0010","start":10,"end":14,"surface":"幽王宮𣵀","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000217","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m039-0016","start":16,"end":18,"surface":"幽王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000217","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m039-0028","start":28,"end":31,"surface":"伯陽甫","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000218","status":"source_identified"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-004-zhou","book_id":"b-shiji-004","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-004-zhou"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:p040","text":"三年，幽王嬖愛褒姒。褒姒生子伯服，幽王欲廢太子。太子母申侯女，而為后。後幽王得褒姒，愛之，欲廢申后，并去太子宜臼，以褒姒為后，以伯服為太子。周太史伯陽讀史記曰：「周亡矣。」昔自夏后氏之衰也，有二神龍止於夏帝庭而言曰：「余，褒之二君。」夏帝卜殺之與去之與止之，莫吉。卜請其漦而藏之，乃吉。於是布幣而策告之，龍亡而漦在，櫝而去之。夏亡，傳此器殷。殷亡，又傳此器周。比三代，莫敢發之，至厲王之末，發而觀之。漦流于庭，不可除。厲王使婦人裸而譟之。漦化為玄黿，以入王後宮。後宮之童妾既齔而遭之，既笄而孕，無夫而生子，懼而棄之。宣王之時童女謠曰：「厭弧箕服，實亡周國。」於是宣王聞之，有夫婦賣是器者，宣王使執而戮之。逃於道，而見鄉者後宮童妾所棄妖子出於路者，聞其夜啼，哀而收之，夫婦遂亡，奔於褒。褒人有罪，請入童妾所棄女子者於王以贖罪。棄女子出於褒，是為褒姒。當幽王三年，王之後宮見而愛之，生子伯服，竟廢申后及太子，以褒姒為后，伯服為太子。太史伯陽曰：「禍成矣，無可奈何！」","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m040-0003","start":3,"end":5,"surface":"幽王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000217","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m040-0007","start":7,"end":9,"surface":"褒姒","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000219","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m040-0010","start":10,"end":12,"surface":"褒姒","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000219","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m040-0014","start":14,"end":16,"surface":"伯服","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000220","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m040-0017","start":17,"end":19,"surface":"幽王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000217","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m040-0024","start":24,"end":27,"surface":"太子母","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名者、群體、官號或文字疑讀；保留錨點，不補熟知姓名或假定同指。"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m040-0027","start":27,"end":30,"surface":"申侯女","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000221","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m040-0036","start":36,"end":38,"surface":"幽王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000217","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m040-0039","start":39,"end":41,"surface":"褒姒","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000219","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m040-0047","start":47,"end":49,"surface":"申后","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000221","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m040-0052","start":52,"end":56,"surface":"太子宜臼","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000222","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m040-0058","start":58,"end":60,"surface":"褒姒","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000219","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m040-0064","start":64,"end":66,"surface":"伯服","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000220","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m040-0070","start":70,"end":75,"surface":"周太史伯陽","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000218","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m040-0096","start":96,"end":99,"surface":"二神龍",